WEBVTT

00:08:28.716 --> 00:08:31.556
no doubt that's probably
true of this arena,

00:08:31.596 --> 00:08:37.636
that general diversity is not reflected
in the top ranks of society.

00:08:38.396 --> 00:08:41.836
Now, of course, I'm not suggesting
there's anything wrong with this,

00:08:41.836 --> 00:08:45.956
assuming it is truly based
on a meritocracy.

00:08:45.996 --> 00:08:48.076
And for culturally diverse women like me,

00:08:48.116 --> 00:08:50.196
well, you know that glass ceiling?

00:08:50.676 --> 00:08:53.076
It's double glazed for people like me.

00:08:53.556 --> 00:08:56.956
And that's why I've got heels like this,
to be able to crack through it.

00:08:57.516 --> 00:09:02.276
Only a tiny percentage of ASX directors
are culturally diverse women.